{"login": "PaulRGU2014", "location": "Denver, CO", "commits": [{"sha": "03474adb508a634869442428743b9f4c0d3d5af5", "message": "feat: Add contact form API with rate limiting and reCAPTCHA validation\n\n- Implemented a new API route for handling contact form submissions.\n- Added rate limiting to prevent abuse of the contact form.\n- Integrated Google reCAPTCHA for spam protection.\n- Created HTML rendering for email notifications.\n- Added email sending functionality using Microsoft Graph API.\n\nfeat: Create NotFound page for 404 errors\n\n- Added a user-friendly 404 Not Found page with a link to return home.\n\nfeat: Implement DisableDraftMode component\n\n- Created a button to disable draft mode with a loading state.\n\nfeat: Add email utility functions for sending support emails\n\n- Created utility functions for sending emails with attachments using Microsoft Graph API.\n\nfeat: Implement HTTP Basic Authentication middleware\n\n- Added middleware for HTTP Basic Authentication to protect certain routes.\n\nfeat: Create Accordion component for collapsible content\n\n- Developed an Accordion component to display collapsible sections of content.\n\nfeat: Add IconLibrary component for reusable icons\n\n- Created a library of reusable icons for consistent usage across the application.\n\nfeat: Implement ScrollSync component for synchronized scrolling\n\n- Developed a ScrollSync component to synchronize scrolling between multiple child components.", "created_at": "2026-02-23T22:01:59Z", "repo": "next-sanity-template", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "11dddcac2a7865e7c4899ce3e76c06e6a1b5cdbf", "message": "revert change", "created_at": "2025-01-16T20:29:35Z", "repo": "next-sanity-template", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "95e92c58502ed9c71b098e6ddd234b8c0947da6b", "message": "update script", "created_at": "2025-01-16T20:13:48Z", "repo": "next-sanity-template", "file_sampled": fal